%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '22px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(VouchersController + VouchersService)
    participant Vouchers as MongoDB (vouchers)

    Note over Admin,Vouchers: DELETE — DELETE /vouchers/:id (chi Admin, soft delete)
    Admin->>FE: Xac nhan xoa voucher
    FE->>BE: DELETE /vouchers/:id
    BE->>Vouchers: findOne({ _id: id, deletedAt: null })

    alt Voucher khong ton tai hoac da bi xoa
        Vouchers-->>BE: null
        BE-->>FE: 404 Voucher khong ton tai
        FE-->>Admin: Hien thi loi
    else Tim thay
        Vouchers-->>BE: voucher document
        BE->>BE: voucher.deletedAt = new Date()
        BE->>Vouchers: voucher.save()
        Note over BE,Vouchers: Soft delete — ban ghi van ton tai trong DB<br/>Chi bi loc ra boi query { deletedAt: null }<br/>Co the khoi phuc neu can, khong mat du lieu
        BE-->>FE: 200 Xoa voucher thanh cong
        FE-->>Admin: Xoa thanh cong
    end
